# outerBaseAtom -- the leftmost atom of a LEFT-nested three-segment
# dotted path `(a.B).c`: "a". "" for shallower shapes.
# outerBaseAtomId -- the interned name id of outerBaseAtom's leftmost atom.
outerBaseAtomId: function {ast: Ast.view n: Node.view} out zast.nameid is {
    match (
        n
